    <p>Players connected to the shared reference appear first, highest rating to lowest. Players awaiting calibration follow alphabetically; their local estimates do not determine an overall position. <?php echo e($allAgesBall ? 'Gender filters change' : 'Age and gender filters change'); ?> the player list, not the rating. Equal scores use a stable name order. Positions stay the same when searching or paging.</p>
    <p>Scores are out of 100 and provisional. Compare players connected to the same singles reference group. Disconnected players receive a provisional within-group estimate with low confidence until suitable match evidence calibrates them against the reference. <?php if(\Livewire\Mechanisms\ExtendBlade\ExtendBlade::isRenderingLivewireComponent()): ?><!--[if BLOCK]><![endif]--><?php endif; ?><?php if($ballLevel): ?>Only evidence assigned to <?php echo e(\App\Services\Performance\BallRatingModel::LABELS[$ratingStage]); ?> contributes to this list. Published final placings provide weaker evidence than played singles.<?php else: ?> Verified completed singles count across all ball colours and court formats, without category-based rating offsets.<?php endif; ?><?php if(\Livewire\Mechanisms\ExtendBlade\ExtendBlade::isRenderingLivewireComponent()): ?><!--[if ENDBLOCK]><![endif]--><?php endif; ?> This is not an official selection ranking.</p>
    <p>Recent results carry more weight. Matches up to two years old can connect groups; comparisons relying on a link older than one year are marked Low confidence — historical connection.</p>
